# Weekly blog build (Mejor Vida)

When creating or editing **weekly insurance update** posts or the blog index:

1. Follow **`tools/blog-build-rules.md`** end-to-end — especially digest vs full-article length, Spanish-only indexing, FAQ/internal links, **primary-authority Fuentes/Sources** (no unknown blogs or vendor sites), and **§4 anti-regression** (no prior-week schema/hreflang/preload leftovers).

2. Digest = 150–250 words/story; full articles = ~600–900 words (email-draft depth). ES/EN structure parity. EN pages `noindex`; sitemap Spanish only.

3. After a new post: update **`blog.html`** / **`en/blog.html`** cards and **`sitemap.xml`** (Spanish URLs + `blog.html` lastmod).

Reference: `blog/weekly-insurance-update-2026-07-19.html` + paired full articles.
